    "rotationData": {
        "champion_id": "arcade",
        "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0q8_XMYk4xI",
        "source_channel": "Marvel Contest of Champions",
        "summary_parts": [
            "Push the opponent towards their corner. Throw a heavy to place a <span style=\"color: #00cc6d\">Poisonous Cloud</span> and begin building <span style=\"color: #d4d121\">Arcade Tokens</span>. Bait a special while they are near the <span style=\"color: #fcba03\">Booby Trap</span> and <span class=\"tooltip\">Punish<span class=\"tooltiptext\"><span class=\"tooltip-title\">Punish</span><br>Striking the Opponent before they have fully finished the specified action.</span></span> with a combo, chaining a heavy at the end to trigger the trap stun and gain more tokens. Build to 3 bars of power, throw a light-ending combo to disable your SP3, then throw SP2 in the corner. Throw SP1 to add the rest of your debuffs. You can play more aggressively once you have tokens because they give you autoblock as a safety net. Choose the prefight immunity/benefit that fits the matchup before the fight."
        ]
    },
